<!--
    Themed ("monochrome") icon layer.

    The launcher keeps only this layer's alpha channel and tints it with the system
    palette, so the eyes and mouth cannot be painted in Paper Base the way the colour
    foreground paints them - they have to be actual holes, or the droplet flattens into
    a featureless blob whenever themed icons are switched on.

    One path, evenOdd fill: the body outline encloses three counter-shapes, which the
    rule punches out.
-->
